  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n{他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\nPair: {狭|せば}まる (intransitive - to narrow by itself)\nPattern: Xを{狭|せば}める\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{狭|せば}めている - is narrowing (action in progress)\n{狭|せば}めてある - has been narrowed (resultant state)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {範囲|はんい}を{狭|せば}める - to narrow the range\n- {選択肢|せんたくし}を{狭|せば}める - to narrow the options\n- {目|め}を{狭|せば}める - to narrow one's eyes (squinting)\n- {包囲|ほうい}を{狭|せば}める - to tighten an encirclement\n\nUSAGE:\n{目|め}を{狭|せば}める is used when squinting or looking suspiciously at someone.",
